    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωχ-εία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωχ-ηΐη</span></b> ,, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beggary,
				mendicity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πτωχηΐην ἀπῖκται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἐσχάτην π. ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					936b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς π. καταστάντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					32.10
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				618a
			</span></i>: prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωχείας πενία ἀδελφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					549
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>poor relief,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cod.Just.
				1.3.41.23
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῖον</span>, τό, <i>poorhouse</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.2.15.1
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Aed.</u>
				5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				187.22
			</span></i>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωχῖον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>MAMA</u>
				3.783
			</span></i>; Lat.<i>ptochium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cod.Just.
				1.3.48.1
			</span></i>.</div>
